# Ad-hoc editor screenshots produced during local review / debugging.
# These are not committed artifacts — keep the repo root clean.
editor-*.png

# Pnpm transient side effects. The project uses npm (see CLAUDE.md
# "常用命令" — `npm install` / `npm test` / `npm run build`); pnpm
# 9 sometimes writes these files when invoked by accident and they
# should never be committed. Re-generate with `npm install` to
# get a clean package-lock.json.
pnpm-lock.yaml
pnpm-workspace.yaml

# Ad-hoc deploy verification scripts. P3 deploy workflow (and
# occasional hand-runs) drop these at repo root as one-off
# Playwright health checks. They're useful as artifacts but
# shouldn't be committed; the real test suite is
# `npm run test:e2e` (Playwright in tests/e2e/).
verify-deploy.mjs
verify-security.mjs
